  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alzheimers is the other pandemic with more than 1,8 million families affected in Mexico. Alzheimer&apos;s has no cure yet, but drug-free therapy is available that slows down dementia&apos;s progress so that persons with dementia and their families will have more quality of life. This is proven by semestral screening. Help Centro Mexicano Alzheimer, pioneer in offering non-drug therapy online in real time (onlive) and National Health Award 2022, to reach all Mexican states and Spanish speaking communities</narrative>
  </description>
